### A2 — Tenant policy verification before declaration

Used `app()->dbForTenant(54)` with:

```sql
SELECT policy_version, capability_id, capability_version, provider,
       caller_module, allowed_roles, grant_state, is_active
FROM capability_authorization_policies
WHERE is_active = 1
  AND policy_version = (
      SELECT MAX(policy_version)
      FROM capability_authorization_policies
      WHERE is_active = 1
  )
  AND capability_id IN (:c1, :c2, :c3)
ORDER BY capability_id, capability_version, provider
```

Initial results:

| Capability | Version | Provider | Caller modules | Roles | Grant |
|---|---:|---|---|---|---|
| `akira.policy.set_roles@1` | 1 | `cms-akira-core` | `cms-akira-shell,cms-akira-core` | `admin,administrator,superadmin` | granted, active |
| `akira.user.set_active@1` | 1 | `cms-akira-core` | `cms-akira-shell,cms-akira-core` | `admin,administrator,superadmin` | granted, active |
| `akira.user.update_role@1` | 1 | `cms-akira-core` | `cms-akira-shell,cms-akira-core` | `admin,administrator,superadmin` | granted, active |

All three explicitly permitted caller `cms-akira-shell`.

